667, 668, 669 and vacation of streets and alleys within said Blocks of South Cheyenne Addition,
Cheyenne, Wyoming (located east of Morrie Avenue, being portions of Logan Avenue, 5th
Street and Campstool Road).”  Reporting for Public Services Committee, Mr. Collins moved to
adopt with staff recommendations #1 and 2 and Planning Commission condition #3, seconded by
Mr. Valdez.   Motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.
