(total amount not to exceed $259,632.00).
[CA]
Consideration of Bid #R-18-11 for furnishing twelve new 2011 Police vehicles from
Spradley Barr Motors, Cheyenne, Wyoming, for the Police Department (2007-2010 1% Sales
