appointment).
Re-appointment of Leda Pojman to the Housing and Community Development Advisory
Council.  Mr. Valdez moved to approve, seconded by Ms. Broyles.  Motion carried.  Voting
“yes” – all members of the governing body present with the exception of Mayor Kaysen who did
not vote (Mayoral appointment).
Announcement was made of the Appointment of Katherine Palmer, Carol Wurdemann,
Ted Gertsch and Leland G. Clabots to the Housing and Community Development Advisory
Council; Ray Fertig, Jr. to the Building Code Board of Appeals; Keith C. Eldred  to the Board of
Adjustment, and Robin Zimmer to the Public Transit Advisory Board, to be confirmed February
